  "description": "Pure WF5 capability. Consumes a health snapshot (from core.aggregate-team-action-health) and applies multi-signal thresholds to decide digest vs escalate.\n\nImplemented and smoke-tested matrix (use_cases):\n- digest when only one signal is met\n- escalate when multiple signals are met\n- invalid_input when overdue_count is negative\n\nKnown limitations (intentional in 1.0.1):\n- reason_code config_error removed; the guest does not emit that code\n- Decision only; no notification delivery",
